OL,3,GNEWSASixth of prison leavers released
OL,4,Ainto homelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne in six prison leavers in London are
OL,7,Freleased into homelessness, according
OL,8,Fto analysis by the social justice group
OL,9,FNacro, as the Probation Service
OL,10,Fstruggles with what is being dubbed a
OL,11,F"chronic workload crisis".
OL,13,FIt is part of a wider picture of
OL,14,Ffailing support for people leaving
OL,15,Fprison, says Kelly Grehan, policy
OL,16,Fmanager at the justice reform charity
OL,17,FRevolving Doors.
OL,19,FThe government says it is working to
OL,20,Freduce prison leaver homelessness and
OL,21,Finvesting in probation services.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
