OL,3,GNEWSASixth of prison leavers released
OL,4,Ainto homelessness
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 50,000 people in England are
OL,7,Fso-called "prolific offenders", trapped
OL,8,Fin cycles of repeated low-level crime,
OL,9,Flike shoplifting and drug possession,
OL,10,Faccording to the charity.
